archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-04-21T10:17:32Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T17:08:40Z","closed_at":"2026-05-25T16:47:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in:\n- 4.7-dev5 | arm64: Reproducible\n\n### System information\n\nOS: Windows 11 | Version: Godot 4.7-dev5 | Rendering: Vulkan, Forward + | Architecture: arm64 (Snapdragon X Plus)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen i open a previous project (In my case 4.6.1-stable) with the 4.7-dev5 vuild to update it, the only thing it does, is change `config/features=PackedStringArray(\"4.7\", \"GL Compatibility\")` in the project file (from `config/features=PackedStringArray(\"4.6\", \"GL Compatibility\")`  and then it crashes while the loading bar is at \"Creating Autoload Scripts\" step (for me is roughly 60%).\n\nWhen the console version is opened, the only thing it pronts before crashing is: \"UNREACHEABLE executed!\".\n\nCreating a new project doesn't appear to reproduce the issue.\nCreating a new project in 4.6.1 and then opening it with 4.7-dev5 also doesn't appear to cause this issue.\n\nHaven't had the time to test with other projects yet.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen project with 4.6-stable:\n- Should open just fine\n\nOpen project with 4.7-dev5 version:\n- Crash occurs \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nTo achieve this MRP i started to gradually strip my main project from all unnecessary scenes and resources (That still didn't fix the issue):\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26928657/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118806/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}